  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tax Common Fund 2013-2017 - RBM consultant Tax ATM</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Tax Common Fund 2013-2017</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till Skattemyndigheten i Mocambique f&#xf6;r att bli mer effektiv och &#xf6;ka int&#xe4;kterna. Fokus i finansiering ligger p&#xe5; att ta fram ett nytt   datasystem f&#xf6;r skatteadministration, kapacitetsuppbyggnad, folklig    utbildning om skatt samt revision och inspektion av skatteuppb&#xf6;rd.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Tax Agency In Mozambiqe to become more effective and   increase revenues. Focus in the financing is put on a new             computerized system for tax administration, capacity development,     civic education and tax audits.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The?development?intervention?is?foreseen?to?lead?to?increased?tax?revenues?for?the benefit?of?financing?of?Mozambique&#x2019;s?State?budget,?through?better?obedience?of?tax?regulations?and decreased?risks?of?corruption?in?the?taxation?of?extractive?industries?and?customs.?Increased and stable?tax?revenue?in?Mozambique?will?decrease?the?donor dependency?and?consequently?lead?to less?need?for?budget?support?in?the?medium?to?long?term.?Recent?research?suggests?that capitalising?on?many?of?the?tax?policy?opportunities?available?could?make?a?great?deal?of?difference to?the?potency?of?the?social?fiscal?contract,?and?ultimately?to?the?improvements?in?public?policy?and development?planning.
The strategic objectives of the Programme are
1. Optimization of Mechanisms and Processes for Revenues Collection Strengthen, Enlarge and Modernize the Tax Administration Raising the levels of Institutional Ethics and Integrity
2. Strengthen, Enlarge and Modernize the Tax Administration
3. Raising the levels of Institutional Ethics and Integrity</narrative>
  </description>
